   },
   "meaning": {
    "de": "Welcher Wochentag ist (heute)?",
    "en": "what day is it?"
   },
   "mnemonic": {
    "de": "무슨 = welcher, 요일 = Wochentag.",
    "en": "무슨 = which, 요일 = day of the week."
   },
   "note": {
    "de": "Zwischen 무슨 und 요일 schiebt sich oft ein n ein: [무슨뇨일].",
    "en": "An extra n often slips in: [무슨뇨일]."
   },
